WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.720
Three patent milestones show how early recorded sound moved from Edison’s phonograph to Berliner’s gramophone.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:12.920
1877. Edison files his phonograph patent application.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:18.320
1878. Edison’s phonograph patent is granted.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.680
1887. Berliner receives a patent for the gramophone.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:30.040
The longer timeline includes the later patent on making sound records and Berliner’s public presentation.
